        "text": "MRT Line 6 runs Uttara to Motijheel. Cheap and fast; a good way to skip traffic."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Bus",
        "has": true,
        "text": "City buses are crowded, noisy and signed only in Bengali. Hard for first-time visitors."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Taxi / ride apps",
        "has": true,
        "best": true,
        "text": "Uber and Pathao work in Dhaka. CNG auto-rickshaws are cheapest for longer rides; meters are rarely used, so agree the fare."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Rental car",
        "has": false,
        "text": "Driving yourself is not recommended; traffic is chaotic. Hire a car with a driver instead."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Walking",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Often fastest for short hops; watch pollution and traffic."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Rickshaw",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Cycle rickshaws are quick for short hops. Agree the fare first."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Ferry",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Ferries and rocket steamers leave from Sadarghat river port."
      }
